                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="tech-title">Instron Biopuls Biobath</h4>
                    <p class="tech-text">Temperature-controlled physiological solution bath for uniaxial, biaxial, and shear tissue testing.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tech-card">
                    <div class="tech-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                            <path d="M12 3v18M7 7l5-4 5 4M7 17l5 4 5-4"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="tech-title">5960 Universal Testing Machine</h4>
                    <p class="tech-text">High-precision force and displacement measurement with sub-micron resolution and temperature control.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="tech-card">
                    <div class="tech-icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/>
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.5"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="tech-title">Digital Image Correlation (DIC)</h4>
                    <p class="tech-text">Full-field strain measurement via high-speed camera and stochastic speckle pattern analysis.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Project Visualization -->
        <div class="area-block">
            <h3 class="block-title">Project Visualization</h3>
            <ResearchVideo {...videos.experiments} />
        </div>

        <!-- Testing Process -->
        <div class="area-block">
            <h3 class="block-title">Testing Process</h3>
            <p class="block-text">Our standardized workflow ensures consistent, high-quality mechanical data that feeds directly into constitutive model calibration and simulation validation.</p>
            <ul class="process-list">
                <li class="process-item">
                    <span class="process-num">01</span>
                    <div>
                        <h4>Specimen Preparation</h4>
                        <p>Controlled defrosting, gentle cleaning, and region-of-interest trimming to preserve native tissue structure.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="process-item">
                    <span class="process-num">02</span>
                    <div>
                        <h4>Mounting &amp; Equilibration</h4>
                        <p>Secure clamping without tissue damage; acclimation to physiological temperature and solution.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="process-item">
                    <span class="process-num">03</span>
                    <div>
                        <h4>System &amp; Data Setup</h4>
                        <p>Configure load cells, displacement sensors, and DIC cameras; record force, position, and strain fields.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="process-item">
                    <span class="process-num">04</span>
                    <div>
                        <h4>Experiment Run</h4>
                        <p>Apply controlled loading protocols (ramp, cyclic, stress-relaxation) and capture full mechanical response.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Interested CTA -->
